docs/
tests/
logs/
artifacts/
data/prepared/
data/prepared/*
data/full_load_staging/
data/logs/
data/app/
data/raw/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.md
!README.md
!data/README.md
